Fixes #911
Navigating back and forth between steps and stages is very fast now and does not trigger excessive network requests/server-side processing. Notably, no network requests are performed after fetching the latest console output following the completion of a step.

Testing done

 pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {
        stage('Hello') {
            steps {
                script {
                    for(int i=1; i<=3; i++) {
                        stage("Stage - ${i}") {
                            for(int j=1; j<=10; j++) {
                                sh "sleep 1 && echo ${j}"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

